# Raw and processed data are regenerated by scripts/run_ingestion.py
# and the individual ingestion modules in src/terrarisk/ingestion/.
# They are not committed because of their size (roughly 115 MB) and
# because they can be reproduced from the documented data sources.
# See docs/data_sources.md.
data/raw/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
data/processed/*
!data/processed/.gitkeep

# Experiment results (experiments/*/results/*.json) are kept in the repository.

*.zip
